Package: rnaseqViz
Title: Visualization Tools for RNA Sequencing Data Analysis
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person(given = "Enoch", family = "Larrey", email = "enochlarrey10@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides reusable visualization functions for exploring
    RNA sequencing differential expression results. Supports volcano
    plots, principal component analysis, heatmaps, and comparisons
    between statistical models. Designed for reproducible transcriptomics
    analysis and integration with interactive Shiny applications.
